Revision history for NYTProfM (product modernization)

6.15  2026-08-17
        v0.2.15 testdrive: do not eval around &$raw — caller() showed
        NYTProfM.pm on every logger (CXt_EVAL is visible; package-DB
        subs are not). DESTROY still emits SUB_RETURN if the callee
        dies. RPM 6.15-9. Smoke g13_logger_caller_smoke.sh.

        v0.2.14 testdrive: goto Memoize:: so memoize('fn') does not look
        up DB::fn (Cannot operate on nonexistent function). RPM 6.15-8.
        Smoke g12_memoize_caller_smoke.sh.

        v0.2.13 testdrive: fail-closed nodebug_stash — isGV_with_GP before
        GvCV so a GP-less stash GV no longer SEGV on file= attach (v0.2.12
        hint-magic walk). XSUB CVs are not walked as OP*. RPM 6.15-7.
        Smoke g11_nodebug_stash_nogp_smoke.sh.

        v0.2.12 testdrive: attach survival for DateTime/Rex/CPAN graphs —
        no CORE::GLOBAL::require wrap; CvNODEBUG on BHES/Variable::Magic
        before $^P 0x01; goto inherited ::import, XSLoader, DynaLoader.
        20-app catalog + 10 diverse top-10 Docker drivers (--app, --engine
        both attach-survival vs 6.15). RPM 6.15-6. Not exclusive-time match.

6.15  2026-08-15
        v0.2.11 testdrive: flame default-on — nytprof-cli html emits the
        call-tree flame (all_stacks_by_time.svg/.folded + inlined index
        section) unless --no-flame, matching oracle nytprofhtml ('flame!'
        defaults to 1). Profiles with no call edges skip flame artifacts
        (oracle no-calls parity). Library HtmlRenderOptions::default()
        unchanged (flame off). RPM 6.15-5.

6.15  2026-08-15
        v0.2.10 testdrive: RPM 6.15-4 refreshes the bundled EL8 nytprofm-cli
        so the v0.2.8 HTML v2 visual refresh (carded tables, dark mode,
        flame polish) actually ships; release workflow now fails closed on
        a stale prebuilt via nytprof-cli.source-sha256 (LC_ALL=C pinned —
        locale-dependent sort burned the v0.2.9 tag, never released).
        No collector / wire / default changes vs v0.2.8.

        v0.2.8 testdrive: omitted compress is zlib-6; opt-in durable=1
        sealed publish; collection-only RPM 6.15-3 (nytprofm-cli, sits
        beside stock nytprofhtml); aggregate=1 fail-closed (ADR-0013
        proposed). Not PAUSE/COPR/GPG. Not default-on durable.

        v0.2.7 testdrive: operator HTML v2 (chrome/IA/sort/compact time),
        opt-in call-tree --flame (hover + click-to-source), live attach
        incl/excl (clock + pending child excl), Rocky dual-engine Docker
        lab, apples-to-apples compare. RPM 6.15-2 upgrades 6.15-1.
        Not PAUSE/COPR/GPG. Not oracle DOM / flamegraph.pl.

6.15  2026-08-13
        v0.2.6 testdrive: Rocky 8 perl-NYTProfM RPM (unsigned) ships
        -d:NYTProfM, I03 nytprofhtml wrappers, and bundled EL8 nytprof-cli.
        Rebuild: scripts/packaging/build_el8_module_rpm.sh. Tag workflow
        .github/workflows/release-el8-rpm.yml attaches the EL8 RPM.
        Not PAUSE/COPR/GPG.

        Identity Option B: CPAN DISTNAME NYTProfM, debugger
        Devel::NYTProfM, $VERSION 6.15 (match baseline/6.15 pin).
        Operators switch to perl -d:NYTProfM. Stock Devel::NYTProf /
        -d:NYTProf remains the oracle pin and report-facade namespace.
        Not PAUSE uploaded. Not Provides perl(Devel::NYTProf).

7.00  2026-08-13
        L01 optional --allow-lossy convert (strict remains default).
        Oracle default-calls1 v5→v6 refuses without the flag; with
        --allow-lossy writes NYTPROF6 (NV truncate + NEW_FID extras /
        TIME_BLOCK.sub_line drop). Not packing convert; not TEST-008.

        E4-01 TEST-008 slice 1: fixtures/e4/oracle-pair default-calls1
        oracle v5 + product format=v6. Shipped from_path / report --json
        leaf/mid/edge equality. Not full TEST-008 corpus; not format=dual.

        E3-mixed MVP: C-produced fixtures/v6/from-c/mixed.nytprof
        (SOURCE + INDEX + SUMMARY) decoded by shipped
        e3_decode_mixed_writer_bytes / e3_c_mixed_*. Not TEST-008;
        not COL-008; not CLI v6 collection default.

        P02 SEC-012 checklist + SEC-002 job MVP: see
        docs/contracts/SEC_012_RELEASE_REVIEW_CHECKLIST_v0.md and
        scripts/ci/sec002_continuous_fuzz_mvp.sh (wraps shipped
        tools/oracle/selftest_security_fuzz.sh / decode_fuzz; honest
        SKIP without cargo). Not independent sign-off; not GA marketing;
        not cargo-fuzz/AFL.

        P01 GA-candidate honesty cut: see
        docs/RELEASE_NOTES_GA_CANDIDATE_v0.md. Collection drop-in preview
        on advertised flavors (CPAN D1-A / Rocky default D1-B only).
        Not SEC-012 complete; not uploaded to PAUSE; R3/R4 not flipped.

        J02 CPAN TRIAL notes-ready (attach-preview): see
        docs/RELEASE_NOTES_CPAN_TRIAL_v0.md. Devel::NYTProf 7.00 drop-in
        collection preview. Not uploaded to PAUSE. Residuals: tablesorter
        WAIVE, not full opcode/entersub, collection_default v5, EL8 RPM
        D1-B. Not BUILD-003-FULL.

        J01 CPAN hygiene: MakeMaker NAME is Devel::NYTProf; $VERSION
        read from collector/xs/Devel/NYTProf.pm (KD-16/17). Dist listing
        excludes baseline/, target/, prefix/.
